  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with or enjoy crude, dehumanizing humor that relies on disgust-based prejudice. This includes people who find humor in mocking or ridiculing those perceived as 'dirty,' 'unrefined,' or 'unacceptable' by societal standards. The meme appeals to an audience that may be attracted to shock value and toxic attitudes toward differentness, particularly those who engage with internet memes that normalize hatred or contempt toward marginalized groups. The audience is likely to be online users who appreciate dark humor, irony, or cynicism, especially when it comes to social stigma and legal protection from hate, even if such humor is harmful. The meme's target community may also include individuals who are aware of or have experienced social stigma themselves, and who may find the meme's message relatable or amusing in a twisted way, despite its harmful implications.",
